# Reviewed exceptions to the pre-publication audit.
#
# Format:  <path-prefix>  <rule-keyword>  # <reason>
#
# BOTH fields are required. A path-only waiver would hide every other rule on
# that path, which defeats the point of the audit.
# Waived hits are still printed; they only stop blocking.

OOChatIOS/Core/Protocol/  endpoint  # Local-agent discovery: the client probes
                                    # loopback for an agent running on the same
                                    # machine before falling back to the relay.
                                    # The literals are the probe list.
OOChatIOSTests/           endpoint  # Tests feed loopback URLs into discovery and
                                    # into private-IP classification. The address
                                    # is the test input, not a shipped endpoint.
README.md                 endpoint  # Documents the loopback probe above.

OOChatIOS.xcodeproj/      github    # Swift Package dependencies resolve from their
                                    # upstream repositories (swift-markdown-ui,
                                    # NetworkImage, swift-cmark).
.github/workflows/        github    # Release downloads for SwiftLint and Trivy.
